{"analytics_identifier":null,"base_path":"/government/news/east-anglian-prisons-expanded-to-make-streets-safer","content_id":"d38c020e-a694-44ed-b7b1-14b683af0755","description":"Major refurbishment works on a wing at HMP Norwich, originally built in the 1880s, have now been completed, as part of Government action to ensure there is always space to lock up dangerous criminals.","details":{"attachments":[],"body":"<div class=\"govspeak\"><div class=\"call-to-action\">\n  <ul>\n    <li>More than 400 additional prison places across HMPs Norwich and Wayland to lock up dangerous criminals</li>\n    <li>Latest step in drive to build 14,000 extra places nationwide by 2031</li>\n    <li>Part of this Government’s mission for safer streets and to ensure country never runs out of jail space again</li>\n  </ul>\n</div>\n\n<p>The project has delivered 170 additional prison places to the Victorian-era jail, equipped with modern security features including reinforced windows to tackle 21st century threats like drones.</p>\n\n<p>A new sports hall has also been added, ensuring prisoners can access vital physical activity and rehabilitation opportunities that help to reduce reoffending, cut crime and keep the public safe.</p>\n\n<p>The project has been delivered while preserving the jail’s historic character and protecting the Norwich skyline. Its completion comes a week after a key milestone in progress at HMP Wayland which will provide a further 247 prison places in the region.</p>\n\n<p>This development is the latest step in Government plans to build 14,000 extra places nationwide by 2031 - with 3,100 already added since July 2024 - to keep streets safer and ensure the country never runs out of prison space again.</p>\n\n<p>It comes after only 500 places were added to the estate in the fourteen years to April 2024.</p>\n\n<h4 id=\"minister-for-prisons-probation-and-reducing-reoffending-lord-timpson-said\">Minister for Prisons, Probation, and Reducing Reoffending, Lord Timpson, said:</h4>\n\n<blockquote>\n  <p>We’re fixing the broken prison system we inherited, taking the action necessary to ensure we always have the space needed to lock up dangerous criminals.</p>\n\n  <p>In less than two years, we have already delivered 3,100 places, with thousands more underway - including through vital refurbishments like at HMP Norwich and the new houseblock under construction at Wayland.</p>\n\n  <p class=\"last-child\">These new, modern facilities are part of our plan to ensure punishment works to cut crime and keep the public safe.</p>\n</blockquote>\n\n<p>HMP Norwich’s chapel was also refurbished as part of the construction, reflecting the important role faith can play in helping offenders turn their backs on crime.</p>\n\n<p>The new wing has been named the Elizabeth Fry wing, in honour of the Norwich-born social reformer and philanthropist who pioneered prison reform in the 19th century.</p>\n</div>","change_history":[{"note":"First published.","public_timestamp":"2026-06-05T14:27:34Z"}],"emphasised_organisations":["dcc907d6-433c-42df-9ffb-d9c68be5dc4d","37a2a3c3-ccd7-46b0-8b81-199a746a2768"],"images":[{"caption":"","content_type":"image/jpeg","sources":{"s216":"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/6a22c0cf56960b0542c0b0bd/s216_E_Wing__11_.JPG","s300":"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/6a22c0cf2cdcfdb7436abfe5/s300_E_Wing__11_.JPG","s465":"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/6a22c0cf56960b0542c0b0bc/s465_E_Wing__11_.JPG","s630":"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/6a22c0cf8e85b4e5346abfe1/s630_E_Wing__11_.JPG","s712":"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/6a22c0cf56e988a798b386f1/s712_E_Wing__11_.JPG","s960":"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/6a22c0cf56e988a798b386f0/s960_E_Wing__11_.JPG"},"type":"lead"}],"political":true},"document_type":"press_release","first_published_at":"2026-06-05T15:27:34+01:00","links":{"available_translations":[{"api_path":"/api/content/government/news/east-anglian-prisons-expanded-to-make-streets-safer","api_url":"https://www.gov.uk/api/content/government/news/east-anglian-prisons-expanded-to-make-streets-safer","base_path":"/government/news/east-anglian-prisons-expanded-to-make-streets-safer","content_id":"d38c020e-a694-44ed-b7b1-14b683af0755","document_type":"press_release","links":{},"locale":"en","public_updated_at":"2026-06-05T14:27:34Z","schema_name":"news_article","title":"East Anglian prisons expanded to make streets safer","web_url":"https://www.gov.uk/government/news/east-anglian-prisons-expanded-to-make-streets-safer","withdrawn":false}],"emphasised_organisations":[{"analytics_identifier":"D18","api_path":"/api/content/government/organisations/ministry-of-justice","api_url":"https://www.gov.uk/api/content/government/organisations/ministry-of-justice","base_path":"/government/organisations/ministry-of-justice","content_id":"dcc907d6-433c-42df-9ffb-d9c68be5dc4d","details":{"acronym":"MOJ","brand":"ministry-of-justice","default_news_image":{"high_resolution_url":"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/5a37db21ed915d5a62fdc762/s960_ministry-of-justice.jpg","url":"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/5a37db21e5274a7908e352d9/s300_ministry-of-justice.jpg"},"logo":{"crest":"single-identity","formatted_title":"Ministry<br/>of Justice"},"organisation_govuk_status":{"status":"live","updated_at":null,"url":null}},"document_type":"organisation","links":{},"locale":"en","schema_name":"organisation","title":"Ministry of Justice","web_url":"https://www.gov.uk/government/organisations/ministry-of-justice","withdrawn":false},{"analytics_identifier":"EA1213","api_path":"/api/content/government/organisations/hm-prison-and-probation-service","api_url":"https://www.gov.uk/api/content/government/organisations/hm-prison-and-probation-service","base_path":"/government/organisations/hm-prison-and-probation-service","content_id":"37a2a3c3-ccd7-46b0-8b81-199a746a2768","details":{"acronym":"HMPPS","brand":"ministry-o